{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:261353542007b21a","name":"Slippery Maneuver","source":{"id":"source:reference-261353542007b21a","title":"Slippery Maneuver","revision":19771,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:34:54Z","sha256":"8e2fc707ded2b82a820cc40ff206b2f1c75b7e1af375cf00a107ae11d9c640a4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19771","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Slippery%20Maneuver&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-261353542007b21a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are adept at finding ways out of tough situations.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dodge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dodge","referenceId":"reference:9444f216899dc20b"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," You can apply the effects of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dodge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dodge","referenceId":"reference:9444f216899dc20b"}," feat against attacks made from two opponents. In addition, when you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Withdraw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Withdraw","referenceId":"reference:164546a9c5481480"}," Action to move away from a target against whom you use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dodge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dodge","referenceId":"reference:9444f216899dc20b"}," feat, you can move at your full ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},". You still provoke an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," if you must move more than 1 square to escape a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatened Area"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatened_Area"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," The benefit of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dodge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dodge","referenceId":"reference:9444f216899dc20b"}," applies to one target. Once you clear a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatened Area"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatened_Area"},", you can continue to move up to a total of half you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
